          'Now {AND, OR, NOT} is complete: by the minterm theorem every function is an OR of ANDs of literals. Substitute the NAND constructions above for those three operations and the whole function becomes a NAND network. (The {NOR} case is the dual: swap $+$ with $\\cdot$ and 0 with 1.) $\\blacksquare$',
